hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1486","[AI-translation] Abu Salama bin Abdur Rahman se Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat kartay hain ke jab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke aik ki beemari doosray ko nahi lagti aur safar aur haama ki koi asal nahi to aik dehati bola ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Oonton ka kya haal hai? Rait mein aisay saaf hotay hain jaisay ke hiran aur phir aik kharishi oont un mein jata hai aur sab ko kharishi kar deta hai? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke phir pehlay oont ko kis ne kharishi kiya tha? Aik doosri riwayat mein hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke adwa, teera, safar aur haama koi cheez nahi hain. Adwa se murad kisi beemari ka mutaaddi, achhoot, hona, teera ka matlab kisi cheez se badfaali pakarna, safar se murad safar ke maheena ko manhoos samajhna, jaisay aaj bhi kuch log samajhtay hain aur haama se murad ullu hai ke jisay Arab manhoos samajhtay thay. (Muslim: 7/30). Baab: Beemar oont tandrust par na laye. (La adwa se murad khud bakhud lagna hai; safar se murad Muharram ko muakhkhar karna hai.)"
"1487","[AI-translation] Ibn Shihab se riwayat hai ke Abu Salama bin Abdur Rahman bin Auf (raziyallahu anhu) ne un se bayan kiya ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aik ki beemari doosray ko nahi lagti, is se murad ye hai ke koi beemari kisi se khud bakhud nahi lagti. Doosray kisi ko bhi lagti hai to Allah ke hukm se lagti hai. Isi liye beemar oont ko tandrust oont ke paas na lanay ka hukm diya hai. Aur Abu Salama ye hadees bhi bayan kartay thay ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke beemar oont tandrust oonton ke paas na laya jaye. Abu Salama ne kaha ke Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) in donon hadeeson ko Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat kartay thay, phir us ke baad unhon ne ye hadees ke beemari nahi lagti bayan karna chhor di aur ye bayan kartay rahay ke beemar oont tandrust oont par na laya jaye. Haris bin Abu Zibab ne, jo Abu Huraira ke chacha zaad bhai thay, kaha ke main tumhein sunta tha Ae Abu Huraira ke tum ham se is hadees ke saath aik aur hadees bayan kartay thay jis ko tum ab bayan nahi kartay, wo hadees ye hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aik ki beemari doosray ko nahi lagti. Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne inkaar kiya aur kaha ke main us hadees ko nahi pehchanta, albatta Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ye farmaya ke beemar oont tandrust oont ke paas na laya jaye. Haris ne un se us baat mein us had tak jhagra kiya ke Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ghussay hue aur unhon ne Habsh ki zubaan mein kuch kaha. Phir Haris se poocha ke tum samajhtay ho ke main ne kya kaha? Haris ne kaha ke nahi. Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main ne yehi kaha ke main us hadees ke bayan karnay ka inkaar karta hun. Abu Salama ne kaha ke meri umar ki qasam! Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ham se us hadees ko bayan kartay thay ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke aik ki beemari doosray ko nahi lagti phir maloom nahi ke Abu Huraira us hadees ko bhool gaye ya aik hadees se doosri hadees ko unhon ne mansookh samjha. Sahih Bukhari mein naskh ka zikr nahi hai balke sirf ye hai ke ham ne Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ko us hadees ke siwa koi hadees bhooltay nahi dekha. (Muslim: 7/31). Baab: Nau ka inkaar. (Famaa raahu se murad Haris ka israar hai; abaitu se murad inkaar hai; naskh se murad aik qaul ka doosray ko mansookh karna hai.)"
"1488","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Na to aik ki beemari doosray ko lagti hai, na haama hai, na nau ki koi haqeeqat hai aur na safar ki. Nau sitaray ke tuloo o gharoob ko kehtay hain jaisay Arabon ka bhi khayal tha aur aaj kal ke najoomiyon ka bhi ke falan sitaray ki wajah se barish hui waghera. (Muslim: 7/32)"
"1489","[AI-translation] Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aik ki beemari doosray ko nahi lagti, na nahoosat koi cheez hai aur na ghool koi cheez hai. Ghool se murad awaam ka ye khayal hai ke jungle mein shayateen hotay hain jo raat ko chiraagh ki tarah chamaktay hain kabhi logon ki rehnumayi kartay hain aur kabhi qatl kar detay hain. (Muslim: 7/32). Baab: Mubtala se bachna. (Jamhoor ulama ne kaha Arab ghilaan ko shayateen samajhtay thay; iza taghawwalat wali hadees zaeef hai.)"
"1490","[AI-translation] Shuraid (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Saqeef ke logon mein aik jazaami shakhs tha. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se kehla bheja ke ham ne tujh se baiat le li tum laut jao. (Muslim: 7/37). Baab: Achay faal ke baaray mein. (Nabi juzam ko mutaaddi samajhtay thay, isi liye ihtiyat ki, jo tawakkul ke khilaf nahi.)"
"1491","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay ke badfaali koi cheez nahi, yani kisi ko manhoos samajhna, aur behtar faal hai. Logon ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Faal kya cheez hai? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke wo naik baat jo tum mein se koi sunay. (Muslim: 7/33). Baab: Ghar, aurat aur ghoray mein nahoosat."
"1492","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat kartay hain ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Agar koi nahoosat yaqeeni ho sakti hai to ghoray, aurat aur ghar mein ho sakti hai. (Muslim: 7/34)"
"1493","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat kartay hain ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Agar, nahoosat, kisi cheez mein hai to wo ghar, khadim aur ghora hai. (Muslim: 7/35)"
